  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped plantains and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the vegetable broth, tomato paste, and cumin, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Add the miniature marshmallows and stir to combine.",
    "Wrap the pot in ti leaves and simmer for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs."
